guide forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood
title Felwood, Moonglade & Winterspring
faction Horde
levels 59-60
zone Felwood

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Left out: A Strange One (6605).
# Flow (2026-11-20): the finisher after Silithus: 50-60/06 ends in Orgrimmar -> Splintertree Post -> Eridan (Linken's
# Memory) -> Bloodvenom Post (Trull's Wild Guardians) -> Irontree Woods (Toxic Horrors) -> Moonglade (Umber, Rabine) ->
# Winterspring (Donova: Strange Sources, Winterfall Runners; Salfa; Mau'ari's Luck Be With You, whose shards lie among
# the Frostmaul giants of Frostwhisper Gorge, on the way to Darkwhisper Gorge) -> Everlook -> Winterfall Village.
# Greta Mosshoof's chain, Salve via Hunting and the Red Key moved to 50-60/05's Felwood stop at about 56.5 (they are
# level 54-58). The older notes below describe the export.

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  when !has 14047 x60
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
# Built from the simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits 102-116) and
# machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet. The end of the
# Horde leveling chain.
#
# Toxic Horrors and Winterfall Runners (5086, 5087) end the Winterfall
# Firewater chain from 03-winterspring (taken since 0.3.7). Optional here:
# Runecloth (6031), which Meilosh gives and takes only from Friendly with the Timbermaw (quest data: 3,000).
#
# Flow: the Undercity -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (cloth donations) -> fly to
# Splintertree Post -> ride north into Felwood: the Emerald Sanctuary (Greta,
# Eridan) -> Jaedenar's braziers -> the Sanctuary -> Shadow Hold -> the
# Sanctuary -> north past Jaedenar to Bloodvenom Post (Winna, Trull) ->
# Irontree Woods -> Timbermaw Hold (Meilosh) -> through the tunnel to
# Moonglade (Umber, Rabine) -> back through Timbermaw Hold into Winterspring
# (Donova Snowden) -> Everlook (Umi) -> grind to 60 at Frostwhisper Gorge.
#
# Deviations from the export, for a smooth finish:
# - (2026-11-20) Greta's chain moved to 50-60/05. Linken's Memory (3942) and Silver Heart (4084, its claws and
#   heart from Irontree Woods on the ride north) bracket the guide at the Emerald Sanctuary; Aquementas (4005) leads
#   to Tanaris and Un'Goro and stays out. Trull takes Wild Guardians (4741) on the way north and its last part
#   (4721, Berserk Owlbeasts north of Everlook) and Guarding Secrets (4882) at the end, after Winterspring.
# - Dropped trips that cost a long flight or ride for a few quests: the
#   Blasted Lands, Swamp of Sorrows and Burning Steppes stops (3501, 2623,
#   2801, 2681, 2702, 2701, 4810; the Fallen Hero's chain is worth well under
#   a third of a level behind a flight from the Undercity and a zeppelin
#   back), Stranglethorn (1036, 4621: Bloodsail reputation and elite targets;
#   8240: a Zul'Gurub raid item), the Burning Steppes' Mother's Milk (4866:
#   Blackrock Spire), Alterac Mountains (7241: a battleground quest, dropped
#   with its accept), Ratchet and Duke Hydraxis after 60 (4502, 6804, 6805).
# - The Undercity stop moved first (the route starts next to it) and holds no
#   quests any more: Champion of the Banshee Queen (5961) is taken in 04 and
#   handed in in 05, the Duke (6030) in 05; ... and a Batch of Ooze (4294)
#   needs Un'Goro slime samples the route never collects.
# - The two Orgrimmar stops are one, on the way to Felwood: the runecloth
#   donations (7836, 7824). Calm Before the Storm (4509, 4511) went with Pawn
#   Captures Queen in 06; Betrayed (3507) is not on the route (Azshara is 02).
# - No hearth binds: the guide ends where it grinds. The export's binds (the
#   Undercity, Booty Bay, Orgrimmar, Everlook, Light's Hope) served the
#   dropped trips.
# - The route ends at the Emerald Sanctuary after the last Winterspring loop; the top-up to 59.72 on the Rabid
#   Shardtooths of Frostwhisper Gorge comes before the last hand-ins, which reach 60 (level model 2026-11-20, the version
#   that skips steps behind their conditions: from 59.2, about 264 model minutes; it was about 80 minutes when the route
#   reached this guide at 59.7). The hand-ins after it are worth about 0.3 level, Mau'ari's Luck Be With You included.
#
# Left out (besides the above): the Undercity's cloth donations (7813, 7814,
# 7817), Camp Mojache (7492) and Vivian Lagrave (4769), never turned in;
# Shards of the Felvine (5526: Dire Maul); Guarding Secrets' second part (4883, Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff).

