  zone Felwood
  goto 51.2,82.1 "The Emerald Sanctuary"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southern Felwood

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  zone Felwood
  tip Fly to Splintertree Post and ride north-west along the road out of Ashenvale into Felwood. The Emerald Sanctuary is the druids' camp just past the border.
  turnin 3942                         -- Eridan Bluewind, inside
  accept 4084
  note Silver Heart's Silvery Claws and Irontree Heart come from Irontree Woods on this guide's ride north; Eridan takes them at the end of the guide, back here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Northern Felwood

step Rakaiah
  when onquest 5204
  zone Felwood
  tip Only if Jessir Moonbow sent you after Rakaiah (the Blood Red Key's chain): on the ride north, turn west into Jaedenar. Rakaiah (56) stands by the remains of Trey Lightforge at the edge of the camp, well under you now; Trey's remains go back to Jessir at the end of this guide.
  kill 9518 quest 5204.1              -- Rakaiah
  turnin 5204                         -- Remains of Trey Lightforge
  accept 5385

step Bloodvenom Post
  zone Felwood
  tip Ride north along the road, past Jaedenar, to Bloodvenom Post.
  turnin 4741                         -- Trull Failbane
  accept 4721
  note Trull's last Wild Guardians are the Berserk Owlbeasts north of Everlook, on this guide's Winterspring loop; he takes them at the end of the guide, back here.

step Toxic Horrors
  tip Ride north up the Felwood road to Irontree Woods; the Toxic Horrors ooze between the trees, and most of them drop a droplet. The Irontree Wanderers and Stompers (52-53) there carry Eridan's Irontree Heart, the Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves his Silvery Claws.
  tip Careful: Ancient Irontree Walkers, level 59 elites, walk among the Toxic Horrors, and Vartrus the Ancient (63, elite) roams the woods: work the Horrors at the north tip of Irontree Woods, one at a time.
  collect 12822 quest 5086.1 @50.6,22.4
  collect 11172 quest 4084.1
  collect 11173 quest 4084.2

