  turnin 5086
  accept 5087

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterspring

step Winterfall Runners
  tip The runners walk the road from Timbermaw Hold toward Winterfall Village in small groups; wait by the road near Donova and kill them as they pass. Each one carries a crate.
  tip Careful: Turning in spawns three or four level 56-57 Winterfall ambushers that attack you; you can escape them while mounted, in stealth or with Feign Death, and they then gather by the lake so you can take the next quest.
  collect 12829 quest 5087.1

step Salfa
  accept 8464
  note Winterfall Activity's village is north-east of Everlook, on this guide's way back from Darkwhisper Gorge.

step Meilosh
  when complete 6031
  when rep "Timbermaw Hold" Friendly
  zone Felwood
  tip With 30 Runecloth in your bags: follow the road north to Timbermaw Hold; Meilosh trades just inside the entrance.
  turnin 6031                         -- Below ground

step Kernda
  when onquest 8470
  when rep "Timbermaw Hold" Neutral
  zone Felwood
  tip The Deadwood totem from Felpaw Village, if you are Neutral with the Timbermaw now (the Timbermaw Hold reputation guide gets you there): Kernda waits at the tunnel mouth of Timbermaw Hold.
  turnin 8470                         -- Kernda walks around here: look inside the circle on the map

step Witch Doctor Mau'ari
  zone Winterspring
  tip Ride east along the road to Everlook: Harlo Wigglesworth sends you to Witch Doctor Mau'ari, who stands in the town, on the way to Frostwhisper Gorge.
  accept 6606                         -- Harlo Wigglesworth: A Little Luck
  turnin 6606                         -- Witch Doctor Mau'ari
  accept 969

step Winterspring
  zone Winterspring
  goto 59.8,74.3 "Darkwhisper Gorge"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkwhisper Gorge and Winterfall Village

step Darkwhisper Gorge
  tip Ride east, then south down Frostwhisper Gorge. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59-60: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, at the south end.
  goto 59.8,74.2 "Darkwhisper Gorge"
  complete 4842

step Frostmaul Shards
  when onquest 969
  tip The shards lie on the ground along the west side of Frostwhisper Gorge, among the Frostmaul Giants and Preservers. Careful: the giants are elites of 59-60: pick up the shards that lie clear of them, wait for a patrol to pass, and leave Kashoch the Reaver (60, east side) alone.
  collect 12334 x4 quest 969.1 @58.7,67.4 map 1452

step Level 59.7
  zone Winterspring
  when level<59.72
  tip Top up here to about level 59.7 before the last hand-ins: Umi, Vizzie, Mau'ari, Winterfall Village, Donova, Salfa, Trull and Eridan take you the rest of the way to 60. The Rabid Shardtooths (59) of Frostwhisper Gorge, just north of the strange source, give far more experience than the furbolgs by Timbermaw Hold. Or, with a group, run the Scholomance dungeon or the Stratholme dungeon instead.
  goto 60.1,71.2 map 1452 "Rabid Shardtooth"
  level 59.72 grind 7446              -- grind on Rabid Shardtooth

step Ice Thistle yetis
  when onquest 93406
  zone Winterspring
  tip On the ride north to Everlook, the Ice Thistle Yetis (55-56) in the hills south-east of the town carry Vizzie's Missing Mail: four pieces.
  collect 258323 x4                   -- Missing Mail

step Are We There, Yeti?
  tip Ride north to Everlook.
  kill 10978 quest 5163.1 @61.5,38.6 map 1452 "Scare Legacki with Umi's Mechanical Yeti"

step Everlook
  turnin 5163                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker
  turnin 93406                        -- Innkeeper Vizzie, in the inn: Unfrozen Deliveries

step Witch Doctor Mau'ari
  when onquest 969
  turnin 969

step Winterfall Village
  tip The furbolg village fills the valley north-east of Everlook. Kill Shamans first; they heal. High Chief Winterfall (59, elite) and Xandivious (62) are in the cave at the back: stay out.
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2
  kill 7438 quest 8464.3
  kill 7439 quest 8464.1

step Berserk Owlbeasts
  tip The Berserk Owlbeasts (58-59) roam the slopes of Frostsaber Rock, north of Everlook and west of the furbolg valley. Now and then an owlbeast drops a Blue-feathered Necklace: use it to start Guarding Secrets.
  kill 7454 quest 4721.1 @63.3,20.7
  collect 12558 optional              -- Blue-feathered Necklace
  accept 4882 item 12558 optional

step Donova Snowden
  tip Ride back west along the road to Frostfire Hot Springs.
  turnin 4842
  turnin 5087                         -- Donova Snowden

step High Chief Winterfall
  when group 5121
  tip A group choice: Donova sends you after High Chief Winterfall (59, elite, with his guards) in the cave at the back of Winterfall Village, back east past Everlook; Xandivious (62) shares the cave: leave him. The High Chief carries a log for Donova, and her next errand goes to Kelek Skykeeper at the Emerald Sanctuary, this guide's last stop.
  accept 5121                         -- Donova Snowden
  kill 10738 quest 5121.1 @69.6,38.3  -- High Chief Winterfall, in the cave
  collect 12842                       -- the log he carries
  accept 5123 item 12842
  turnin 5121                         -- Donova Snowden, back west at the hot springs
  turnin 5123
  accept 5128                         -- for Kelek Skykeeper at the Emerald Sanctuary

step Salfa
  tip North of Donova, at the tunnel's Winterspring exit.
  turnin 8464

step Beads for Salfa
  tip Salfa takes the beads only once Winterfall Activity is handed in: any Winterfall furbolg can carry them, and the camps just south of Salfa are the closest.
  goto 31.6,36.6 "Frostfire Winterfall camp"
  collect 21383 x5

step Salfa
  when has 21383 x5
  turnin 8469 direct

